{"title":"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If a machine produces 150 items in one minute, how many would it produce in 10 seconds?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9b212e7d658c0bda2a1690b954c3e508d989e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 25 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"378\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The machine produces <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/e/f5e10e5f3aa7c766cb27c3ad319fa526f71588cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> items in one minute, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> seconds. Therefore, in 10 seconds, the machine will produce\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/4/52423aada8f3ad18b15eb5215bee40492089c582.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{150}{60} \\cdot 10 = \\boxed{25}\\]\" width=\"114\" height=\"37\" /> items.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Pr